agic-story/devouring-house-2021-11-19","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/devouring-house-2021-11-19#:~:text=And%20then%20suddenly%20it,blood%20within%20his%20hands.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Devouring House\" by Brian Evenson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 19 Nov 2021."}},{"id":"devouring-house-2021-11-19-e12","summary":"Strefan staggers out of the ruin, weak and starving, and fears he might die after all.","participants":["strefan-maurer"],"location":"innistrad","importance":"major","page":"stories/devouring-house-2021-11-19","order":442,"story_date":"2021-11-19","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":122,"quote":"perhaps I won't.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/devouring-house-2021-11-19#:~:text=perhaps%20I%20won%27t.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Devouring House","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Brian Evenson"],"date":"2021-11-19","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/devouring-house-2021-11-19","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/devouring-house-2021-11-19#:~:text=perhaps%20I%20won%27t.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Devouring House\" by Brian Evenson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 19 Nov 2021."}},{"id":"stensia-e3","summary":"Strefan Maurer attacks Heron's Light Hold, killing the knights and forcing Sigarda to flee.","participants":["strefan-maurer","sigarda"],"location":null,"importance":"minor","page":"wiki/stensia","order":1522,"story_date":"","storyline":"","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":9,"quote":"The hold was attacked by Strefan Maurer , and the knights were all killed, forcing Sigarda to flee.","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Stensia#:~:text=The%20hold%20was%20attacked,forcing%20Sigarda%20to%20flee.","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Stensia","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wi